    "notes-body": {
      "id": "notes-body",
      "type": "text",
      "only": [
        "web",
        "notebook"
      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "notes-paragraph-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "原论文：Rethinking “RL Generalizes, SFT Memorizes”: The Role of SFT Data，arXiv:2611.14912v1，2026-11-11。作者 Yunlong Hou、Fengzhuo Zhang、Yuan Cheng、Jiachun Pan、Xingyao Li、Zhuoran Yang；机构 NUS、Yale、Cisco Foundation AI。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "notes-paragraph-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "主文模型 Qwen2.5-7B；附录 Qwen3-8B-Base。在 DAPO 数学题训练，通用推理为12项任务归一化至0—100后平均。不是单个任务正确率。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "notes-paragraph-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "数据口径：39,623条正确轨迹+98,641条最终答案错误轨迹=138,264条。这里不是数据生成API调用次数或端到端总成本，不以题数乘8推出未报告的总量。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "notes-paragraph-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "主要分数来自主文图 plot_1_exp1_4_reasoning、plot_3_mix2_reasoning 与附录表 tab:benchmark_results、tab:eval_std、tab:qwen3_8b。±为评测集标准误，不含训练种子变异。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "notes-paragraph-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "方法共138类，LLM标注可多标签；出现至少100次算覆盖；频率末20%称长尾。distribution_method_usage 的101→132是总方法覆盖，不是长尾方法数。MMLU-Pro的40→108为正确轨迹内方法使用计数，不是新增答对题数。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "notes-paragraph-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "原图取自源码；单题轨迹、方法点图与流程图为示意。最佳混合比例随模型与规模变化。优质SFT数据大量取自已有RL模型；不证明完全无需RL或SFT普遍优于RL。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "notes-slides": {
      "id": "notes-slides",
      "type": "text",
      "only": [
        "slides"
